s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eBHgEO bnCcLn rid-539"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/wright-stander-icon_sitting_bad_standing_good.png?v=1709930382" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/wright-stander-icon_sitting_bad_standing_good.png?v=1709930382 1536w" width="310" height="150" alt="wright-stander-icon_sitting_bad_standing_good.png__PID:a819d256-f5e4-49ca-977c-5babb92eeeb0" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-kWtorq hnOOBS rid-534 pf-image-1"/><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ggpkNl jdwwxc rid-536 pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-bkSTSn bFfrxq pf-159_">Reduces Strain On Lower Back</span></h3><p class="sc-dNsUpz ctpSpj rid-538 pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-bkSTSn bFfrxq pf-162_">Standing is a more ergonomic work position. Sitting for long periods of time causes numerous issues including tight hipflexors, hamstrings, and lower back fatigue.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="pf-c"><div data-pf-type="ContentListItem" class="sc-bzBgjn fopAXb rid-549"><div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND rid-548 pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eBHgEO bnCcLn rid-547"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/wright-stander-icon_saving_trim_time.png?v=1709930406" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/wright-stander-icon_saving_trim_time.png?v=1709930406 1536w" width="219" height="150" alt="wright-stander-icon_saving_trim_time.png__PID:d256f5e4-59ca-477c-9bab-b92eeeb06505" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-kWtorq hnOOBS rid-542 pf-image-1"/><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ggpkNl jdwwxc rid-544 pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-bkSTSn bFfrxq pf-169_">Cut Tight Spaces; Less Trimming</span></h3><p class="sc-dNsUpz ctpSpj rid-546 pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-bkSTSn bFfrxq pf-172_">The Stander has a shorter length than any other mower of the same width. This lets you cut those hard to get spots, saving time trimming.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="pf-c"><div data-pf-type="ContentListItem" class="sc-bzBgjn fopAXb rid-557"><div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND rid-556 pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eBHgEO bnCcLn rid-555"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/wright-stander-icon_stander_fuel_efficiency.png?v=1709930427" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/wright-stander-icon_stander_fuel_efficiency.png?v=1709930427 1536w" width="308" height="150" alt="wright-stander-icon_stander_fuel_efficiency.png__PID:f5e459ca-d77c-4bab-b92e-eeb06505c132" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-kWtorq hnOOBS rid-550 pf-image-1"/><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ggpkNl jdwwxc rid-552 pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-bkSTSn bFfrxq pf-179_">Efficiency Through Productivity</span></h3><p class="sc-dNsUpz ctpSpj rid-554 pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-bkSTSn bFfrxq pf-182_">High productivity allows the Stander to get the job done with less time and fuel. Economical doesn’t have to be slow!</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="pf-c"><div data-pf-type="ContentListItem" class="sc-bzBgjn fopAXb rid-567"><div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND rid-566 pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eBHgEO bnCcLn rid-565"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/wright-stander-icon_easy_bail_off.png?v=1709930445" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/wright-stander-icon_easy_bail_off.png?v=1709930445 1536w" width="162" height="150" alt="wright-stander-icon_easy_bail_off.png__PID:59cad77c-5bab-492e-aeb0-6505c132cb1c" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-kWtorq hnOOBS rid-558 pf-image-1"/><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ggpkNl jdwwxc rid-561 pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-bkSTSn bFfrxq rid-560">Easy Bail-Out Reduces Risk
